    "moduleType": "SUSTAINABILITY",
    "title_zh": "2025年包裝永續趨勢",
    "title_en": "2025 Sustainable Packaging Trends",
    "conclusion_zh": "2025年的包裝市場強調永續性，環保材料如再生內容和單材料設計正在成為主流。根據來源1和來源3，這些趨勢包括對再生材料的需求增長、單材料包裝的普及以及可堆肥解決方案的採用。這些策略不僅符合環境法規，還有助於企業降低碳足跡。",
    "conclusion_en": "The packaging market in 2025 emphasizes sustainability, with eco-friendly materials such as recycled content and mono-material designs becoming mainstream. According to sources 1 and 3, these trends include increased demand for recycled materials, the rise of mono-material packaging, and the adoption of compostable solutions. These strategies align with environmental regulations and help companies reduce their carbon footprint.",
    "insight_zh": "2025年，環保材料和單一材料設計將在包裝行業中占據主導地位。",
    "insight_en": "In 2025, eco-friendly materials and mono-material designs will dominate the packaging industry.",
    "supportingData": null,
    "tags": [
      "sustainability",
      "recycled-materials",
      "mono-material"
    ],
