    "moduleType": "STRUCTURE",
    "title_zh": "摺疊紙盒結構創新",
    "title_en": "Folding Carton Structure Innovations",
    "conclusion_zh": "摺疊紙盒的結構創新正朝著提升貨架吸引力和環保性邁進。來源1和來源5指出，這些創新包括易開特性和減少材料使用，這不僅改善了用戶體驗，還減少了資源浪費，滿足了現代消費者對環保的要求。",
    "conclusion_en": "Innovations in folding carton structures are advancing towards enhanced shelf appeal and sustainability. Sources 1 and 5 highlight these innovations, such as easy-open features and reduced material usage, which improve user experience and reduce resource waste, meeting modern consumers' demand for sustainability.",
    "insight_zh": "摺疊紙盒的新結構設計專注於貨架吸引力和材料效率。",
    "insight_en": "New structural designs in folding cartons focus on shelf appeal and material efficiency.",
    "supportingData": null,
