    "moduleType": "PROCESS",
    "title_zh": "瓦楞紙包裝的數位印刷應用",
    "title_en": "Digital Printing in Corrugated Packaging",
    "conclusion_zh": "瓦楞紙包裝中的數位印刷技術正在迅速被採用。來源2指出，這項技術提高了印刷效率和質量，並支持按需生產模式。這允許企業更靈活地回應市場需求，同時減少浪費和庫存成本。",
    "conclusion_en": "Digital printing technology is rapidly being adopted in corrugated packaging. Source 2 indicates that this technology enhances printing efficiency and quality, supporting on-demand production models. It allows businesses to respond more flexibly to market demands while reducing waste and inventory costs.",
    "insight_zh": "數位印刷技術正在革新瓦楞紙包裝，提升效率並降低庫存成本。",
    "insight_en": "Digital printing technology is revolutionizing corrugated packaging, enhancing efficiency and reducing inventory costs.",
    "supportingData": null,
    "tags": [
      "digital-printing",
      "corrugated-packaging",
      "technology"
    ],
