    "title_zh": "全球紙類包裝市場增長趨勢",
    "title_en": "Global Paper Packaging Market Growth Trends",
    "conclusion_zh": "到2025年，全球紙類包裝市場預計將以4.2%的年複合增長率增長。來源4指出，這一增長受到電子商務需求激增和創新阻隔塗層技術的推動。這些技術增強了紙類包裝的耐用性和功能，滿足了不同行業的需求。",
    "conclusion_en": "The global paper packaging market is projected to grow at a CAGR of 4.2% by 2025. Source 4 highlights that this growth is driven by the surge in e-commerce demand and innovative barrier coating technologies. These technologies enhance the durability and functionality of paper packaging, meeting the needs of various industries.",
    "insight_zh": "電子商務需求激增和阻隔技術創新正在推動紙類包裝市場的增長。",
    "insight_en": "The surge in e-commerce demand and barrier technology innovations are driving the growth of the paper packaging market.",
    "supportingData": null,
    "tags": [
      "market-growth",
      "e-commerce",
      "barrier-coating"
    ],
