    "title_zh": "2025年中秋節月餅市場定價策略",
    "title_en": "2025 Mid-Autumn Festival Mooncake Pricing Strategies",
    "conclusion_zh": "2025年中秋節期間，觀光飯店採取了多樣化的月餅定價策略，以應對市場需求的變化。來源4指出，飯店在定價上考慮了市場需求的波動，並預測未來市場將繼續朝向高端化發展。這些策略不僅反映了市場對高品質產品的需求，也顯示出飯店在應對競爭時的靈活性。",
    "conclusion_en": "During the 2025 Mid-Autumn Festival, tourist hotels adopted diverse mooncake pricing strategies to respond to changing market demands. Source 4 indicates that hotels considered market demand fluctuations in their pricing and predicted that the market will continue to develop towards high-end products. These strategies reflect the market's demand for high-quality products and demonstrate hotels' flexibility in dealing with competition.",
    "insight_zh": "飯店在定價上考慮了市場需求的波動，並預測市場將朝向高端化發展。",
    "insight_en": "Hotels considered market demand fluctuations in their pricing and predicted a shift towards high-end development.",
    "supportingData": null,
    "tags": [
      "定價策略",
      "市場需求",
      "高端化"
    ],
