  {
    "id": "cmj6407yz0001wyk04njarx1j",
    "createdAt": "2025-12-14T19:20:00.346Z",
    "updatedAt": "2025-12-14T19:26:23.198Z",
    "moduleType": "TREND",
    "title_zh": "2025年中秋節月餅市場趨勢",
    "title_en": "2025 Mid-Autumn Festival Mooncake Market Trends",
    "conclusion_zh": "2025年的中秋節月餅市場呈現出多樣化的趨勢，消費者對於月餅的選擇不再局限於傳統口味，更多創新設計和公益元素的加入成為吸引消費者的關鍵。根據來源3，市場分析顯示消費者行為正在轉變，對於高端及設計感強的月餅禮盒需求增加。此外，來源5指出，儘管月餅銷售額增長，實體零售的需求卻在下降，這表明消費者更傾向於在線購買。",
    "conclusion_en": "The 2025 Mid-Autumn Festival mooncake market is showing a trend towards diversification, with consumers no longer limited to traditional flavors. The inclusion of innovative designs and charitable elements has become key to attracting consumers. According to Source 3, market analysis indicates a shift in consumer behavior, with increased demand for high-end and well-designed mooncake gift boxes. Additionally, Source 5 notes that while mooncake sales are growing, demand in physical retail is declining, suggesting a consumer preference for online purchases.",
    "insight_zh": "消費者對高端及設計感強的月餅禮盒需求增加，顯示出市場趨勢的變化。",
    "insight_en": "Increased demand for high-end and well-designed mooncake gift boxes indicates a shift in market trends.",
    "supportingData": null,
    "tags": [
      "市場趨勢",
      "消費者行為",
      "創新設計"
